  "notes": "Two parallel failure origins traced to the same voltage transient (sequencer and inverter), modeled as separate FailureMode chains per rule 5. Battery charger/aux transformer failure explicitly stated to be independent of the sequencer/inverter issues, so modeled as a separate causal branch (not linked to fm_transient). Cause code X (Other) copied verbatim from FORM-366 despite narrative attributing a specific (though origin-unknown) voltage transient; theme captures this nuance. EDGs 13/14 themselves not modeled as failed components since narrative states EDGs would still have started automatically - only the load sequencer is the failed component; EDG system node included for INVOLVES per block_13 but no component-level EDG failure asserted. MDCT/EECW previous-occurrence root causes not modeled as full chains since narrative states those corrective actions are inapplicable here (stub LERs only)."
